    symmetry: in attached orientation, sprite is symmetric perpendicular to contact axis (fliplr for top/bot attach, flipud for left/right attach); required by solver
    contact_edge: exactly N-2 contiguous filled cells on the attachment side of the rotated sprite
    rotation: solver tries rot90 x 0-3; exactly 1 rotation should be valid (avoid rotationally symmetric shapes that create ambiguity)
